  first row: {"id":"10M/1/abstention/0","chatId":"1","category":"abstention","index":0,"question":"What are the qualifications or expertise of Johnny, who collaborated during the code review for tuning logic?","goldAnswer":"","rubric":["Based on the provided chat, there is no information related to Johnny's qualifications or expertise"],"answer":"Based on the memory context, Johnny is a **security analyst** (Source 23).\n\nHis expertise includes:\n*   A strong background in security and documentation (Source 5).\n*   Using the Burp Suite toolkit (including Spider, Scanner, and Intruder) to identify critical web application vulnerabilities (Sources 9, 10).\n*   Performing log analysis with Loki (Source 25).\n\nIn the context of code reviews, he functions as a reviewer who is assigned to pull requests, discusses identified issues, and approves the changes (Source 2).","sources":32,"infra":false,"ms":24037,"answerModel":"gemini-2.5-pro","topK":32,"maxSourceChars":2400,"arm":"raw","encoder":"gpu"}
